The key to piloting Tidus, Yuna's Guardian is understanding its core engine: Tidus shifts counters between creatures at combat, and whenever creatures with counters deal combat damage, he draws a card and proliferates, rapidly compounding +1/+1 counters and loyalty across all permanents.
This is a Bracket 3 build running three Game Changers: Rhystic Study, Cyclonic Rift, Teferi's Protection. It contains zero mass land denial and focuses on high-synergy board development, interactive answers, and an inevitable endgame clock.

# Commander and Core Synergy
Tidus, Yuna's Guardian :: primary commander driving the deck's core strategy
Kami of Whispered Hopes :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage
Inexorable Tide :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage
Evolution Sage :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage
Forgotten Ancient :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage
Danny Pink :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage

# High-Impact Engines and Support
Kalonian Hydra :: premier support piece providing board presence, ramp, or recursion
Heroic Intervention :: premier support piece providing board presence, ramp, or recursion
Counterspell :: premier support piece providing board presence, ramp, or recursion

